{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26593","headline":"送僧贞实归杭州天竺 · 姚合","name":"送僧贞实归杭州天竺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石桥寺里最清凉，闻说茆庵寄上方。\n林外猿声连院磬，月中潮色到禅牀。\n他生念我身何在，此世唯师性亦忘。\n九陌相逢千里别，青山重叠树苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}